    <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-title"><h2>Public Use Files</h2></span>
        <span class="card-content" data-property="content">
            
            <span><div>Public use data files are microdata files and documentation available for public use and do not contain any individually identifiable information. Public use data files are available in a variety of formats for the following surveys:<br><br></div><ul><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/ffrdc-research-development" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">FFRDC Research and Development Survey</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/higher-education-research-development" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">Higher Education Research and Development (HERD) Survey</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/national-survey-college-graduates" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">National Survey of College Graduates (NSCG)</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/national-survey-recent-college-graduates" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">National Survey of Recent College Graduates (NSRCG)</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/national-training-education-workforce" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">National Training, Education, and Workforce Survey (NTEWS)</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/doctorate-recipients" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">Survey of Doctorate Recipients (SDR)</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/graduate-students-postdoctorates-s-e" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">Survey of Graduate Students and Postdoctorates in Science and Engineering (GSS)</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/science-engineering-research-facilities" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">Survey of Science and Engineering Research Facilities</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/survey-of-state-government-research-and-development-public-use-files" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">Survey of State Government Research and Development</a></li><li><a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/scientists-and-engineers-statistical-data-system" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">Scientists and Engineers Statistical Data System (SESTAT) Integrated File</a></li></ul><span>
        </span>
